```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant I as Instalador
    participant V as View
    participant J as JornadaEmpleado
    participant P as Proyecto

    I->>V: POST /jornadas/nueva/
    V->>J: create_jornada()
    J->>P: validate_asignacion()
    P-->>J: OK
    J->>DB: save()
    DB-->>J: OK
    V-->>I: Redirect /jornadas/{id}/
```
